    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d556">

                <pb facs="0757" n="663" xml:id="pg663"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Delgado to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States,<lb/>Matanzas</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1896-09-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September 11, 1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Oscar Cespedes American citizen. Confined castle September 6. Afterwards removed
                    to jail infirmary, Reported very ill. Have informed Consul Lee.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Delgado.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
